sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor A as Platform Management
  participant UI as «boundary»<br/>CategoriesPage
  participant B as «boundary»<br/>ChangeCategoryActiveBoundary
  participant C as «control»<br/>ChangeCategoryActiveController
  participant Category as «entity»<br/>Category
  participant DB as PostgreSQL
  A->>UI: activate or deactivate a category
  UI->>B: PATCH /api/management/categories/{id}/active (JWT)
  B->>C: setActive(Integer categoryId, boolean active)
  C->>Category: setActive()
  Category->>DB: SQL
  DB-->>Category: rows
  Category-->>C: result
  C->>Category: save()
  Category->>DB: SQL
  DB-->>Category: rows
  Category-->>C: result
  C-->>B: CategoryResponse
  B-->>UI: 200 OK JSON
  UI-->>A: show result